  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finabank Equity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finabank is one of the systemically important financial institutions in Suriname. IDB Invest is exploring a potential equity investment in Finabank for up to US$20million. The main purpose of the equity investment will be to strengthening Finabank&#x2019;s capital base to further support the sustainable growth of the Bank&#x2019;s lending portfolio in two areas: (i) Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) lending (increase access to finance for SMEs in Suriname); and (ii) allow Finabank to provide larger loans to their corporate segment in line with expected growth of the economy from 2028.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finabank is one of the systemically important financial institutions in Suriname. IDB Invest is exploring a potential equity investment in Finabank for up to US$20million. The main purpose of the equity investment will be to strengthening Finabank&#x2019;s capital base to further support the sustainable growth of the Bank&#x2019;s lending portfolio in two areas: (i) Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) lending (increase access to finance for SMEs in Suriname); and (ii) allow Finabank to provide larger loans to their corporate segment in line with expected growth of the economy from 2028.</narrative>
